     MOVE "monster_spawn_light_level" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE 25 TO WS-NAME-LENGTH
     CALL "NBT-WRITE-INT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH RD-SPAWN-LIGHT(L-ROW)
